WEBVTT

00:03:56.754 --> 00:04:00.976
because that event
was the scientific revolution,

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.865
ever since which our knowledge
of the physical world

00:04:04.889 --> 00:04:08.744
and of how to adapt it to our wishes

00:04:08.768 --> 00:04:10.744
has been growing relentlessly.

00:04:11.254 --> 00:04:13.854
Now, what had changed?

00:04:13.878 --> 00:04:16.143
What were people now doing
for the first time

00:04:16.167 --> 00:04:20.177
that made that difference
between stagnation

00:04:20.201 --> 00:04:23.206
and rapid, open-ended discovery?

00:04:24.309 --> 00:04:26.318
How to make that difference

00:04:26.342 --> 00:04:29.799
is surely the most important
universal truth

00:04:29.823 --> 00:04:31.467
that it's possible to know.